            <title>[LU-20401] compile warning "include/lustre_compat/linux/inetdevice.h:5: warning: header guard ‘__LIBCFS_LINUX_INETDEVICE_H__’ </title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20401</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Ubuntu:2604 Throws compile warning &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;In file included from lnet/klnds/in-kernel-o2iblnd/o2iblnd.c:14:
include/lustre_compat/linux/inetdevice.h:5: warning: header guard ‘__LIBCFS_LINUX_INETDEVICE_H__’ followed by ‘#define’ of a different macro [-Wheader-guard]
    5 | #ifndef __LIBCFS_LINUX_INETDEVICE_H__
include/lustre_compat/linux/inetdevice.h:6: note: ‘__LIBCFS_LINUX_INETDEIVCE_H__’ is defined here; did you mean ‘__LIBCFS_LINUX_INETDEVICE_H__’?
    6 | #define __LIBCFS_LINUX_INETDEIVCE_H__&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
